## Why Not Just Knowledge Graphs?

| Feature | Knowledge Graph | PosTop |
|---------|-----------------|--------|
| Entities | ✓ | ✓ |
| Relations | ✓ | ✓ |
| Facts | ✓ | ✓ |
| **Entailment** | ✗ | ✓ |
| **Witnesses** | ✗ | ✓ |
| **Costs** | ✗ | ✓ |
| **Refinement soundness** | ✗ | ✓ |

> **Knowledge Graphs** tell you what exists.  
> **PosTop** tells you what's consistent, what implies what, and how to verify efficiently.

